@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Website Navigation

[*] --> Homepage

state "Homepage" as Homepage
state "Projects" as Projects
state "Photos" as Photos
state "Videos" as Videos
state "Career Opportunities" as CareerOpportunities
state "Updates" as Updates
state "Application Form" as ApplicationForm
state "Job Applications" as JobApplications

Homepage --> Projects : [User selects projects]
Projects --> Photos : [User chooses photos]
Photos --> [*] : User navigates away
Photos --> Videos : [User chooses videos]
Videos --> [*] : User navigates away
Projects --> CareerOpportunities : [User selects career opportunities]
CareerOpportunities --> Updates : [User chooses updates]
Updates --> [*] : User navigates away
CareerOpportunities --> ApplicationForm : [User chooses application form]
ApplicationForm --> JobApplications : [User submits application]
JobApplications --> Checked : [Job applications checked]
Checked --> [*] : Completion of check
@enduml
